# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Affordable Remodeling — environment variables
#
# The site currently requires NO environment variables to build or run:
# it is a fully static build (npm run build -> dist/).
#
# The variables below are RESERVED for when the contact form is wired to
# a real inbox (see README "Wire the contact form"). Vite only exposes
# variables prefixed with VITE_ to the client bundle.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

# Formspree form ID for the contact/estimate form (e.g. "abcdwxyz").
# Create one at https://formspree.io, then set this in Vercel:
# Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
